---
const pillars = [
  {
    word: "Deny",
    title: "Default-deny egress",
    body: "Every Task runs behind a NetworkPolicy that blocks all egress. You declare exactly which hosts the agent can reach. Nothing else gets through.",
  },
  {
    word: "Zero",
    title: "Zero RBAC unless asked",
    body: "The agent's ServiceAccount starts with no cluster permissions. If the Task needs to apply manifests, you declare a Role and the operator binds it, minimally.",
  },
  {
    word: "Read",
    title: "Secrets are read-only files",
    body: "Listed secrets project as read-only files on a tmpfs volume. Not environment variables. Not something the agent can enumerate or leak through process listings. Pairs naturally with short-lived credentials, such as GitHub App tokens minted by External Secrets and rotated every 20 minutes.",
  },
];
---

<section id="security" class="border-t border-[color:var(--border)] scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[color:var(--accent)]">Security model</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[color:var(--text)]">
        Three defaults the agent cannot argue with.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {pillars.map((p) => (
        <div class="relative rounded-xl border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] p-6">
          <div class="font-mono text-5xl font-semibold text-[color:var(--accent)]/80 leading-none">{p.word}</div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold text-[color:var(--text)]">{p.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed">{p.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-[color:var(--text-muted)]">
      Full treatment, including Pod Security Standards, timeouts, and garbage
      collection, is in the
      <a class="text-[color:var(--accent)] hover:underline underline-offset-4" href="https://github.com/openconveyor/openconveyor#security-model" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        README security section
      </a>. For rotating agent credentials, see the
      <a class="text-[color:var(--accent)] hover:underline underline-offset-4" href="https://github.com/openconveyor/openconveyor/blob/main/docs/enterprise-auth.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        enterprise auth guide
      </a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
